    "text": "def total_match(lst1, lst2):\n    total_chars = sum(map(len, lst1), lst1)) for _ in lst1)\n\n    total_chars = total_chars for _ in lst2)\n    \n    if total_chars < total_chars:\n        return lst1\n    elif total_chars > total_chars:\n        return lst2\n    else:\n        return lst1\n```\n\nThis function calculates the total number of characters in all the strings in both lists and compares them. It then returns the list that has has the smaller total of number of characters combined. If both lists have the same, it returns the first list.",
